(/* Multisource fermion force.  Includes various optimization choices:) c n
( * ) N
( * 1. General force for any FN-type action. Based on fermion_force_eo_milc.c) N
( *    and optimized to transport only one set of SU\(3\) matrices.) N
( *) N
( * 2. Same as 1 but with indices on CG solutions reversed) N
( *    to maybe improve cache hits) N
( *) N
( * 3. Generalization of fermion_force_asqtad3.c optimized) N
( *    for Asqtad.  Transports the full array of source vectors.) N
( *) N
( * D.T. 12/05 Version  3. created for Asqtad RHMC.) N
( * D.T.  6/06 Versions 1. and 2. created.) N
( * CD   10/06 Collected versions in this file.) N
( * D.T. 6/07 Two levels of smearing) N
( * A.B. 10/07 unitarization and its derivatives,) N
( *            "wrapper" that allows arbitraty levels of smearing) N
( * A.B. 2/08 combine forces from level 2 smearing and then) N
( *           calculate force from reunitarization and level 1 smearing) N
( * A.B. 8/08 Rearrange force to reduce to two Asqtad steps plus) N
( *           whatever correction to Naik term is present \(for c-quark\)) N
( * CD   5/5/2024 Split out from fermion_force_hisq_multi.c ) N
